(7648903, 1243728, 114285, '<td valign="top">Beautiful warmth to this photo, I really loved the footsteps. Congratulations on the blue.</td>', 'Beautiful warmth to this photo, I really loved the footsteps. Congratulations on the blue.', '2019-12-23 19:48:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(7648904, 1243607, 114285, '<td valign="top">I remember when I first tried skiing, funnily enough it was actually in Switzerland. Our tour guide only gave us one hour, that clearly was not enough. I think I spent most of my time getting out of the snow, and then walking back up. Ive never really wanted to try since then, shame because I can tell it would be an awesome experience to be a great skier.<br/> <br/>Congratulations on the red, hope you get to do this as long as possible.</td>', 'I remember when I first tried skiing, funnily enough it was actually in Switzerland. Our tour guide only gave us one hour, that clearly was not enough. I think I spent most of my time getting out of the snow, and then walking back up. Ive never really wanted to try since then, shame because I can tell it would be an awesome experience to be a great skier. Congratulations on the red, hope you get to do this as long as possible.', '2019-12-23 19:52:16.000000', NULL, 0),
